+---
+name: nolane-ui
+description: Use when Codex, Antigravity, or another Open Agent Skills compatible agent performs material UI/UX work in a repository containing NUI.
+---
+
+# Nolane UI bridge
+
+This is a thin discovery bridge, not a second copy of NUI. The canonical bootstrap is `skills/using-nolane-ui/SKILL.md`; the canonical graph is `skills/skill-graph.json`.
+
+When a task materially designs, implements, audits, reproduces or verifies UI/UX:
+1. Read the canonical bootstrap and preserve its route/omission/evidence rules.
+2. Route through `skills/nolane-ui/SKILL.md`; load only triggered owners rather than the whole graph.
+3. For external libraries, agent skills, images or creative tools, apply NUI source/authority/trust/provenance contracts before adoption.
+4. Never treat this bridge, an MCP transport, a copied prompt, or a visual gallery as design authority.
+5. Completion requires the repository/runtime/render evidence demanded by the selected NUI route.
