+40. External media requires **asset-level rights** verification. Search-provider metadata is candidate evidence only; record origin, creator, exact rights/license, verification date, attribution, commercial/modification state, third-party caveats and local transformations.
+41. Creative tools own execution stages, not product truth. Verify live tool capability before routing and preserve a cross-tool provenance chain.
+42. A standalone beautiful asset is not UI completion. Re-render media inside material responsive/temporal states and verify semantics, crop/focal point, overlay contrast, performance, accessibility equivalent and rights lineage.
